// Title: Devtoolslauncher.exe Executes Specified Binary
// Sigma ID: cc268ac1-42d9-40fd-9ed3-8c4e1a5b87e6
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Beyu Denis, oscd.community (rule), @_felamos (idea)
// Date: 2019-10-12 | Modified: 2021-11-27
// ATT&CK: stealth, T1218
// Description: The Devtoolslauncher.exe executes other binary
// False positives:
//   - Legitimate use of devtoolslauncher.exe by legitimate user
// References:
//   - https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/OtherMSBinaries/Devtoolslauncher/
//   - https://twitter.com/_felamos/status/1179811992841797632
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_lolbin_devtoolslauncher.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, microsoft_xdr schema)

DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "\\devtoolslauncher.exe" and ProcessCommandLine contains "LaunchForDeploy"
